{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44695","headline":"玄逵律师言离广府还望桂林去留怆然自述赠怀 · 义净","name":"玄逵律师言离广府还望桂林去留怆然自述赠怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"标心之梵宇，运想入仙洲。\n婴痼乖同好，沈情阻若抽。\n叶落乍难聚，情离不可收。\n何日乘杯至，详观演法流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}